VERSION 5.8 ;
DIVIDERCHAR "/" ;
BUSBITCHARS "[]" ;
DESIGN o8 ;
UNITS DISTANCE MICRONS 1000 ;
DIEAREA ( 0 0 ) ( 5000 3000 ) ;
GCELLGRID X 0 DO 6 STEP 1000 ;
GCELLGRID Y 0 DO 4 STEP 1000 ;
TRACKS Y 50 DO 30 STEP 100 LAYER M1 ;
TRACKS X 50 DO 50 STEP 100 LAYER M2 ;
NETS 16 ;
- d + ROUTED M1 ( 100 850 ) ( 1900 * ) ;
- a + ROUTED M1 ( 100 1050 ) ( 1900 * ) ;
- c + ROUTED M1 ( 100 1250 ) ( 1900 * ) ;
- b + ROUTED M1 ( 100 1350 ) ( 1900 * ) ;
- e + ROUTED M1 ( 100 1550 ) ( 1900 * ) ;
- p + ROUTED M2 ( 3050 100 ) ( * 1000 ) ;
- q + ROUTED M2 ( 3050 1100 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
- r + ROUTED M2 ( 3150 900 ) ( * 1200 ) ;
- s + ROUTED M2 ( 3550 100 ) ( * 1000 ) ;
- f + ROUTED M1 ( 2500 2050 ) ( 2900 * ) NEW M1 ( 2700 2050 ) ( * 2350 ) ;
- g + ROUTED M1 ( 2400 2450 ) ( 3000 * ) ;
- h + ROUTED M1 ( 2400 1750 ) ( 3000 * ) ;
- k + ROUTED M1 ( 2400 1850 ) ( 3000 * ) ;
- t + ROUTED M2 ( 4050 100 ) ( * 600 ) NEW M2 ( 4050 600 ) ( 4350 * ) ;
- u + ROUTED M2 ( 4450 100 ) ( * 1000 ) ;
- v + ROUTED M2 ( 4250 700 ) ( * 1200 ) ;
END NETS
END DESIGN
